chapter.v:
	of the 

	 sons of Kohath, Uriel the chief, and one hundred and twenty of his brethren;
 [2 Sam. 8:5, 6; 1 Kin. 11:23-25]

	of the 

	 sons of Elizaphan, Shemaiah the chief, and two hundred of his brethren;
 [2 Sam. 8:8 g 1 Kin. 7:15, 23; 2 Chr. 4:12, 15,]

	So the 

	 Levites appointed Heman the son of Joel; and of his brethren, Asaph the son of Berechiah; and of their brethren, the sons of Merari, Ethan the son of Kushaiah;
 [2 Sam. 8:18]
